 "components": [
  {
   "id": "game",
   "explanation": "The Mimic Keep prototype the effect lives in: main.gd owns the run, archer.gd auto-fires at the nearest scarecrow in a 120 degree cone, arrow.gd hits and ignites, scarecrow.gd owns Burning (burn_time_left, 4 s, 4 dps); sprites drawn by tools/make_sprites.gd; earlier suites test_rules and test_input; balance_sim and capture_prototype are prototype tools.",
